OL,4,BSarr focused on Palace return after    
OL,5,BLiverpool interest                     
OL,6,GCrystal Palace forward Ismaila Sarr    
OL,7,Gsays he has moved on from Liverpool's  
OL,8,Ginterest in signing him and is keen    
OL,9,Gfor a "fresh start" under new manager  
OL,10,GThomas Frank.                          
OL,12,FThe Senegal international, 28, is keen 
OL,13,Fto put that episode behind him after   
OL,14,FLiverpool explored a move at the end   
OL,15,Fof the summer transfer window.         
